#requires -Version 5.1
<#[
JNS Windows Management Console v5.5.0 in-place updater

Purpose:
- Layer v5.5 Management PC Enrollment over an existing Stage-2 v5.4 install.
- Preserve the v5.4.3 Supervisor/SFTP production fixes in the bundled v5.5 repository source.
- Preserve the current Windows DPAPI vault, package library and Python venv.
- Make a rollback copy of the existing manager source before replacing it.
- Do NOT copy or create shared Home Assistant/SFTP/signing credentials.
#>
